---
import Layout from '../../../components/inference-v2/Layout.astro';
import { learnChapters, inferenceV2Path } from '../../../lib/inference-v2';
const chapters = learnChapters();
---
<Layout title="LLM inference engineering" description="From the first token to efficient production serving, with theory and code in every chapter." slug="" showToc={false}>
 <p>Fourteen chapters follow the progression from inference foundations to production systems. Within each chapter, numbered sections develop the theory, equations, and code before the notebook observations and practical extensions. Hands-on ideas are proposed extensions unless explicitly labeled as recorded lab results.</p>
 <h2>Chapters</h2>
 <ol class="reading-list">
  {chapters.map(ch => (
   <li>
    <a href={inferenceV2Path(ch.slug)}>{ch.title}</a>
    <p>{ch.description}</p>
   </li>
  ))}
 </ol>
</Layout>
<style>
 .reading-list { padding-left: 1.7rem; }
 .reading-list li { padding: .65rem 0 .8rem .35rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e3e8ee; }
 .reading-list li::marker { color: #6b7789; font-size: .9rem; }
 .reading-list a { font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
 .reading-list a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
 .reading-list p { font-size: .92rem; color: #5d6b7b; margin: .3rem 0 0; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
